              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku dakukeŋa kufwayi Isarela hidikuya nakushika, hakutambikani mwanindi Yosefu, hakumwila nindi, Neyi wunantiyili luwi, shaku mwani, chikasa cheyi mwishina dekata dami, wakaŋilaŋa chachiwahi chakubula kutwamba. Bayi wakanjiika mwani, muEjipituku. ",
          "type": "text",
